      "raw": "<p>Hello, I&#39;m new to the SotM forums.&nbsp;</p><p>I was wondering if you guys have a file on a quick sum up of the characters and their play styles? It&#39;s mostly because when I play with friends who are new to the game, I&#39;m kind of bad at explaining how each characters work while playing them, which I&#39;m trying to fix. Is there somehting that was a short summery of the character like:</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><u>Legacy</u>:&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Focus- Defensive, Support. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Minor-Attack. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Style-Legacy is less focuse on physical attacks, and more on supporting the team and take damage for the team. </span></p><p><u><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Visionary:</span></u></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Focus-Stratgy, Diversion/Redirection</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Minor- Attack</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Style- Visionary is best used to&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">anticipat and/or control the next move of the villian. Also, has multiple way of avoiding taking hits.&nbsp;</span></p><p><u>Bunker:&nbsp;</u></p><p>Focus- Attack, Self-Buffer</p><p>Minor-Support&nbsp;</p><p>Style- Bunker focus is on all out attack, with a veraity of modification for different way to deal damage, as well buffing itself.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If there is already one, what&#39;s the link to it?<br />If there isn&#39;t one, I was thinking of making one myself, though I might need a admin/modirator/play tester to apporve it, in case I have it off/wrong on some of the characters.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>[EDIT: Moved to its own thread -- arenson9]</p>",
